# Slovo - English interface text.
#
# UTF-8. One "key = value" per line, split at the FIRST '=' sign.
# Lines starting with '#' are comments.
# Escapes: \n newline, \t tab, \\ backslash.
# Placeholders: %s text, %d number, %0:s %1:d when the word order differs.
# '&' before a letter in a menu item marks its accelerator key.
#
# A key that is missing here is displayed as the key itself and reported in the
# debug log, so nothing breaks - the gap is simply visible.
# Key rule: <zone>.<element>[.<state>] (Slovo_04 C.3).

